Verse 1:
[Eb]We [Fm7]give this [Bbsus]child [Bb7]to[Eb]You,
Our [Fm7]precious [G]gift of [Cm]love.
[Cm7]Help [Bb7]us to lead [Eb]each [Ab]step [Eb]a[Ab]right
[Fm7]With [Cm7]guidance [Bbsus]from[Bb7]a [Eb]bove.

Verse 2:
[Eb]O [Fm7]bless [Bbsus]each [Bb7]child [Eb]of Yours,
[Fm7]And grant [G]when they [Cm]are grown,
[Cm7]They [Bb7]will [Eb]have learned [Ab]to [Eb]love [Ab]Your way,
[Fm7]And [Cm7]choose [Bbsus]it [Bb7]for [Eb]their own.

Verse 3:
[Eb]We [Fm7]give [Bbsus]ourselves [Bb7]to [Eb]You,
[Fm7]And [G]may Your [Cm]Spirit fill
[Cm7]Our [Bb7]hearts [Eb]and home, [Ab]that [Eb]all [Ab]we do
